/Title (We propose an autonomous Edge AI IoT Node. By combining an SDR \(Software Defined Radio\) antenna with a Raspberry Pi 5, we create an independent radar station capable of capturing, decoding, and analyzing flight data locally. Instead of sending data to the cloud, an embedded Artificial Intelligence model evaluates the physical behavior of each aircraft in real-time, instantly flagging anomalies or emergency situations directly at the edge.)
